## Professional Summary

Senior Frontend Engineer with 8+ years of experience specializing in building responsive, accessible, and high-performance web applications using React, TypeScript, and Next.js. Proven track record of architecting component design systems, optimizing Core Web Vitals to sub-second load times, and scaling state architectures across large-scale SaaS platforms. Strong advocate for automated frontend testing, accessibility standards (WCAG 2.1 AA), and close engineering-design collaboration.

